     "source_record": 667,
     "rationale": "Requiring multi-factor authentication (MFA) to register devices in Entra ID, configuring MFA systems to disallow enrolling new devices for inactive accounts, and using conditional access policies to restrict initial MFA device enrollment to trusted locations or devices reduces the success of adversary attempts to add additional devices to an adversary-controlled account.",
     "references": [
      "https://cas.docs.cisecurity.org/en/latest/source/Controls6/#65-require-mfa-for-administrative-access"
     ]
    }
   ]
